{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Send a photo, screenshot or scanned PDF of a table and get it back as rows and columns: the text of every cell, typed values (1,234.50 / 1.234,50 / $12 / 15% become numbers, codes with leading zeros stay text), a CSV string and the cells the OCR was unsure about, so your app asks a person to check only those. Ruled tables use their lines as cell borders; tables without lines are split by aligned gaps. English, German and Bulgarian text. Up to 5 pages per call. Deterministic OCR on our server, nothing stored. For receipts and price lists, data entry automation, no-code flows and back-office tools. Free: 5 calls/day per IP. Paid: Radar API key (from \u20ac9/mo at https://radarbg.com/pricing#starter via X-API-Key) or $0.005/call via x402 at https://radarbg.com/x402/image-to-excel-table.","inputSchema":{"examples":[{"fileContent":"","fileName":"table.png"}],"properties":{"fileContent":{"description":"The image (JPG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, TIFF) or scanned PDF as base64, max 20 MB","type":"string"},"fileName":{"description":"Optional file name, e.g. price-list.jpg","type":"string"},"header":{"default":true,"description":"First row is a header (kept as text, not converted to numbers)","type":"boolean"},"lang":{"default":"eng","description":"Language of the text","enum":["eng","deu","bul","eng+deu+bul"],"type":"string"}},"required":["fileContent"],"type":"object"},"name":"image_to_excel_table","title":"Image to Excel Table API - rows and columns from a photo, screenshot or scanned PDF (OCR)"}
